WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Damn new guy

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:04,930
It's not enough that I must kill you

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:07,610
In the real world, I need to find your assistant

4
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,850
I won't let you go

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:15,620
Dirty rat gives you water water

6
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,060
Not everyone has water

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,620
Cherish it

8
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:28,550
Also, don’t waste it, big brother

9
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,790
Can you give me a sip of your water?

10
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:34,470
The meal just now was so disgusting that I wanted to throw up and get out of here.

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,240
It's probably the two staff members

12
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,040
I collected my things and didn't do anything well.

13
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:40,680
This is the compensation office for me

14
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,280
Calculate their reality

15
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,080
This bottle of water is very rare

16
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,320
It is indeed something you spent money to get.

17
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:53,100
Maybe it's the key to clearing the level. Let me go.

18
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,580
I didn't break the rules, let me go
